WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.531
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.481 --> 00:00:05.020
One stand needs help, and Maya cannot see which one!

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.996
The town is so big!

4
00:00:06.996 --> 00:00:10.252
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:10.252 --> 00:00:12.462
This is Episode 70.

6
00:00:12.462 --> 00:00:14.284
Meet the button board.

7
00:00:14.284 --> 00:00:17.400
The board shows every stand in a little picture.

8
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.210
Green means happy.

9
00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:20.915
Red means help.

10
00:00:20.915 --> 00:00:23.042
Maya taps the red one.

11
00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:24.242
Aha!

12
00:00:24.242 --> 00:00:25.912
No lemons!

13
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:27.392
One button.

14
00:00:27.392 --> 00:00:28.697
Click!

15
00:00:28.697 --> 00:00:30.731
A basket slides in.

16
00:00:30.731 --> 00:00:32.707
The light turns green.

17
00:00:32.707 --> 00:00:35.481
Maya can see everything from one board.

18
00:00:35.481 --> 00:00:39.019
Cups, lemons, how long each stand has been open.

19
00:00:39.019 --> 00:00:41.759
No whispering, no magic words.

20
00:00:41.759 --> 00:00:43.687
Just look and press.

21
00:00:43.687 --> 00:00:46.308
That is the AWS Console.

22
00:00:46.308 --> 00:00:49.506
A screen with pictures and buttons for every helper.

23
00:00:49.506 --> 00:00:52.057
When you are new, you start here.

24
00:00:52.057 --> 00:00:54.126
Now you know the button board!

25
00:00:54.126 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

